Loom: opt-in LOOM_EXP_RING_AT=<bytes>@<offset>[:<offset>...],... pins a compute tile's ring records at fixed
offsets (a leaf layout that keeps DMA fills off its dense banks). Unset: emits byte-identical.
diff --git a/loom/src/loom/target/arch/amd/xdna/aie2p/array/channel_resources.c b/loom/src/loom/target/arch/amd/xdna/aie2p/array/channel_resources.c
